# Used only by frontend/Dockerfile (BuildKit prefers <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# over the root .dockerignore). The context is the repository root, so every
# rule is `**/` or root-relative; it repeats the essentials of the root list on
# purpose, so this image does not depend on the root list being complete.
**/node_modules
**/build
# Monaco bundle copied by scripts/copy-monaco.mjs; its version stamp must come
# from the in-image install, not the host.
**/public/monaco
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
**/.claude
**/.serena
**/.code-review-graph
**/uploads
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/*.md
# Read by the builder itself, never COPY'd into an image.
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
# The other workspace members never belong in the frontend image.
backend
monitoring
plans
docs
